\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  In pray'r now raise your voices,
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 In God our heart rejoices
\par He to our life hath given
\par All needed strength for heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  The stream of years is flowing.
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 Still we are homeward going.
\par From old to new surviving
\par And thro' His mercy thriving.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  In vain would be our doing,
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0 The labour we're pursuing,
\par Alone, we'd prosper never,
\par Unless God watches ever.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. With richest blessing crown us,
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0 In all our ways, Lord, guide us,
\par Give grace, Thou who bestoweth,
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0\qj To all, e'en to the lowest.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

